# Autonomous Evolution Hook

## Overview

Create 1 new SessionStart hook + fix 1 existing hook to make master_investments' evolution pipeline fully autonomous. Currently 5 evolution tasks require manual `/evolve`, `/sync-knowledge`, etc. This plan auto-triggers the Python-only tasks via hook-spawned detached processes.

## Problem

| Manual Task | Script | Current Trigger |
|---|---|---|
| Knowledge hunting | `auto_evolve.py` | Never auto-triggered |
| Scheduled evolution | `scheduled-evolution-loop.py` | Never auto-triggered |
| Batch prediction verify | `batch-auto-verify.py` | Never auto-triggered |
| Persona knowledge refresh | `knowledge-auto-refresh.cjs` | Runs but only `--list-all`, doesn't refresh |

## Solution

- **Phase 1:** Create `evolution-auto-runner.cjs` — checks 4 staleness conditions, spawns Python scripts detached
- **Phase 2:** Fix `knowledge-auto-refresh.cjs` — replace `--list-all` with actual refresh logic
- **Phase 3:** Register hook in `settings.json` + end-to-end test

## Phases

| Phase | Name | Status |
|-------|------|--------|
| 1 | [Create evolution-auto-runner.cjs](./phase-01-create-evolution-auto-runner-cjs.md) | Completed |
| 2 | [Fix knowledge-auto-refresh.cjs](./phase-02-fix-knowledge-auto-refresh-cjs.md) | Completed |
| 3 | [Register hook + test](./phase-03-register-hook-test.md) | Completed |

## Constraints

- All hooks exit 0 (fail-open)
- All spawned processes detached + unref'd
- Lock files expire after 10 minutes
- Log to `.logs/` directory
- No LLM dependency — Python scripts only
